continue, whilst timeout options can be incorperated this would still make
for (n) people shouting "get on with it" whilst you read your book...

Also the sequence of moves would be a hotly debated subject, do players
take a strict turn order according to login order/speed/dex/int or what ?
Are the moves considered to be made simultaniously ?
Is the turn order fluid ? if so is it random/sequenced/divinely inspired ?

