Buffering
> So, what method would be best?  I think that was what the original poster was
> getting at...

(thinks) My suggestion is to have no typeahead buffer at all, when it is
your turn you hit your key, anything typed before that is ignored..

(except perhaps in the case of non 'Move' commands such as Inventory)

This solves some problems of database changes in time that is not 'your turn'

